{"record": "measurement", "run": 0, "timed": true, "case": "math", "prompt": "Nonce 5ed2d054e2ce8629; ignore this identifier.\nA shop discounts a $240 jacket by 25%, then applies 8% sales tax to the discounted price. What is the final price? Show the calculation briefly.", "contract": {"quality_contract_passed": false, "quality_contract_issues": ["response does not contain the correct final price 194.40"]}, "content": "To find the final price, we first calculate the discounted price and then apply the sales tax.\n\n1.  **Calculate the discount amount:**\n    $240 \\times 0.25 = $60$\n\n2.  **Calculate the discounted price:**\n    $240 - 60 = $180$\n\n3.  **Calculate the sales tax on the discounted price:**\n    $180 \\times 0.08 = $14.40$\n\n4.  **Calculate the final price:**\n    $180 + 14", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 71, "total_tokens": 199, "completion_tokens": 128, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0}}, "finish_reason": "length", "elapsed_seconds": 2.607199763006065, "ttft_seconds": 0.21887088599032722, "decode_seconds": 2.3882397130073514, "decode_tokens": 127, "decode_tps": 53.177241509009725, "n_minus_one_tps": 53.177241509009725, "chunks": [{"seconds": 0.21887088599032722, "token_ids": [1206]}, {"seconds": 0.2861355610075407, "token_ids": [1423, 279, 1534, 3240]}, {"seconds": 0.35298651599441655, "token_ids": [11, 567, 1118]}, {"seconds": 0.4231794480001554, "token_ids": [10724, 279, 46086]}, {"seconds": 0.4898800360097084, "token_ids": [3240, 321, 1179, 3668]}, {"seconds": 0.5561205440026242, "token_ids": [279, 6416, 3615, 13]}, {"seconds": 0.6220738999836612, "token_ids": [271, 16, 13, 220]}, {"seconds": 0.6881877179839648, "token_ids": [2972, 46270, 279, 10766]}, {"seconds": 0.7542609439988155, "token_ids": [3202]}, {"seconds": 0.8203387279936578, "token_ids": [64700, 198, 262, 393]}, {"seconds": 0.8864156499912497, "token_ids": [17, 19]}, {"seconds": 0.9553015189885627, "token_ids": [15, 1088, 14695, 220]}, {"seconds": 1.0219342960044742,