{"record": "measurement", "run": 0, "timed": true, "case": "multilingual", "prompt": "Nonce 05a32b25b28d5bcd; ignore this identifier.\n請用繁體中文，以四個簡短條列解釋什麼是寫入時複製（copy-on-write），並包含一個行程 fork 後修改記憶體頁面的例子。", "contract": {"quality_contract_passed": false, "quality_contract_issues": ["response omits copy-on-write"]}, "content": "- **延遲複製機制**：當多個進程共享同一份記憶體時，系統僅建立指標指向相同實體頁面，暫不實際複製資料以節省資源。\n- **寫入觸發複製**：僅當某個進程嘗試修改該共享頁面時，作業系統才會偵測到寫入動作，並立即觸發複製程序。\n- **獨立副本生成**：系統會為該進程分配新的實體記憶體頁面，將原資料複製過去，並更新頁表指向新頁面，確保修改互不影響。\n- **Fork 實例說明**：父行程 `fork()` 出子行程後，兩者初始共享同一記憶體頁；若子行程執行 `data = 10` 修改變數，系統便會複製該頁面給子行程，父行程仍保留原值。", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 69, "total_tokens": 247, "completion_tokens": 178, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0}}, "finish_reason": "stop", "elapsed_seconds": 6.323520650999853, "ttft_seconds": 0.2178242749942001, "decode_seconds": 6.105613391002407, "decode_tokens": 177, "decode_tps": 28.989716293016137, "n_minus_one_tps": 28.989716293016137, "chunks": [{"seconds": 0.2178242749942001, "token_ids": [12]}, {"seconds": 0.2842150189972017, "token_ids": [2972]}, {"seconds": 0.35055970298708417, "token_ids": [97009]}, {"seconds": 0.41686938400380313, "token_ids": [107907, 132433]}, {"seconds": 0.4832121249928605, "token_ids": [116764]}, {"seconds": 0.549611410999205, "token_ids": [332, 4960, 97215]}, {"seconds": 0.615981423004996, "token_ids": [122691]}, {"seconds": 0.6821893620071933, "token_ids": [97257]}, {"seconds": 0.7487477170070633, "token_ids": [96010, 100659]}, {"seconds": 0.81525852100458, "token_ids": [101825, 96544]}, {"seconds": 0.8815874709980562, "token_ids": [147642]}, {"seconds": 0.9480202769918833, "token_ids": [96688, 3709, 103952]}, {"seconds": 1.0144566890085116, "token_ids": [100256, 98255]}, {"seconds": 1.0809797710098792, "token_ids": [120095]}, {"seconds": 1.1495042280002963, "token_ids": [111198]}, {"seconds": 1.2166409110068344, "token_ids": [100603]}, {"seconds": 1.2860238270077389, "token_ids": [121553]}, {"seconds": 1.354073761991458,